dist-offline/
FarmMarshal-Offline.zip

# Generated derivatives — NOT ignored.
#
# The decks reference assets/images/optimized/ and assets/screenshots/optimized/
# directly, so these must be committed or a fresh clone (and every CI deploy)
# renders with broken images. `npm run optimize` regenerates them
# deterministically; the originals in approved/ and original/ remain the
# reviewed masters.

# PDF exports are large and regenerable — see docs/PDF_EXPORT.md
*.pdf

